This repository redistributes a prebuilt Linux binary of NInfer-all.

Upstream: https://github.com/iamwavecut/ninfer-all
Commit:   2caa9016 (upstream master) + PR #468 (dev/bonsai-2-5 @ f84786d9)
Patches:  patches/0002-t5-prism-compat.patch (lossless t5_g128_fp16 -> t2_g128_fp16 + prism_hadamard)
License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Static media libraries linked into ninfer-multicall:
- FFmpeg 9.0.2 (GNU LGPL 2.1 or later, see LICENSE-ffmpeg.txt)
- dav1d 1.5.4 (BSD 2-Clause, see LICENSE-dav1d.txt)

NInfer-all consolidates Neroued/ninfer, Don-Chad/ninfer-3090, and other
forks. Credit for the engine belongs to those authors and the contributors
listed at:

  https://github.com/iamwavecut/ninfer-all/blob/master/CONTRIBUTORS.md

This redistribution adds packaging, compatibility patches, an install script,
and GitHub Releases. It does not claim authorship of the engine.
